ht now happening  on the us-mexico border that would  constitute an insurrection Admiral James  Winnefeld was vice chairman of the Joint  Chiefs of Staff under President Obama  and warns against using the US military  if the president tried to use military  forces in an inappropriate way he would  be violating federal law the National  Guard says it has not received any  notice about sending troops to the  border  and in a statement the Mexican  government says it's immigration policy  is quote a sovereign issue implemented  according to law john chip read for us  at the White House thank you chip
 

